  "prefLabel": "Plc 1002.47 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Executive Director with the Advisory Board of Reflexologists, Structural Integrat",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1002.47 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Executive Director with the Advisory Board of Reflexologists, Structural Integrators, and Asian Bodywork Therapists. The application processing and licensing fees found in Table 1002.47, below, shall apply to the professions regulated by the executive director with the advisory board of reflexologists, structural integrators, and Asian bodywork specialists under RSA 328-H:\n\nTable 1002.47 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Executive Director with the Advisory Board of Reflexologists, Structural Integrators, and Asian Bodywork Therapists\n\nCategory | License Duration | Fee\n\nApplication processing and licensing for license to practice reflexology, structural integration, or Asian bodywork:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $170\n\nSource. #13420, eff 8-8-22; ss by #13703, eff 8-1-23 (formerly Plc 1002.42); ss by #14290, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
